"Building resilient democratic societies therefore demands a multi-layered defense: mandating algorithmic transparency and source-provenance watermarking for synthetic media, sustaining independent investigative journalism, and embedding rigorous media and critical-thinking literacy throughout public education so citizens become active, discerning guardians of shared reality."
