"By the close of their dialogue, both speakers converged on a balanced ethical framework. As Dr. Mercer summarized, 'Effective public health respects personal dignity not by abandoning citizens to predatory markets, but by pairing honest information and supportive environments with proportionate, democratically accountable safeguards.'"
